133
00:05:34,660 --> 00:05:36,120
No, rotundamente no.

134
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:37,800
Tampoco a mi papá.

135
00:05:38,160 --> 00:05:39,260
¡Ah, juguete raro!

136
00:05:39,340 --> 00:05:40,800
