181
00:07:15,020 --> 00:07:15,860
¡Así me llamo yo!

182
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:16,520
¡Soy uno!

183
00:07:16,660 --> 00:07:17,020
Uno.

184
00:07:17,400 --> 00:07:18,880
